  "id": "developmental-language-disorder",
  "term": "developmental language disorder",
  "definition": "Developmental language disorder is a neurodevelopmental condition in which a child has lasting difficulties with language that significantly affect everyday communication, social participation, and learning. It often includes problems with vocabulary and may occur on its own or alongside other neurodevelopmental conditions.",
